            "review_text": "Johnny Tran\nCan Tho, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nGREAT COMMENT\nAug 2024 • Solo\nAbsolutely phenomenal! Minh Phát Roast Duck Rice Shop in Cần Thơ offers the best roast duck rolls I have ever tasted. The crispy skin, succulent meat, and perfectly balanced flavors make every bite a delight. Paired with fresh vegetables and a unique dipping sauce, this dish is an absolute must-try. Highly recommend to anyone visiting Cần Thơ. Five stars! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nRead more\nWritten August 7, 2024",
